Licensing of this repository
============================

This repository is the built Tinta web app and the language data it ships with.

The application code (index.html and assets/) is all rights reserved.

The language packs under packs/ are data, and each file carries the licence of
the source it derives from; see NOTICE. The glosses are this project's own work
and all rights reserved; frequency ranks and readings are CC BY-SA 4.0; lemma
lists are ODbL 1.0; the Mandarin radical map is under the Unicode License v3.
Files under incompatible licences are never merged, and each
repeats its attribution in a `#` header.
